    "body": "Fixed the repeated RDR extraction. The cache validator was trying to parse binary WGD shop files as XML, so a valid cache always failed. It now uses format-appropriate checks. Two consecutive preparations reused the current installed cache with extraction disabled, and no new backup cache was created.",
